Narrator: Panicked, Sutherland rushes upstairs. As he turns off the light, He hears the radio echo through the house.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Smith/Get-Out.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Smith: Get out of there! Suth get out! Get the girls! Suth! Suth!
Narrator: The sound of a bomb whistling towards the lighthouse is heard and a plane can be seen in the distance.
Narrator: Explosions and a woman's scream can be heard. A little girl cries.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Cath No.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: Cath! No! No... no...